{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33048","headline":"代班姬 · 曹邺","name":"代班姬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宠极多妒容，乘车上金阶。\n歘然赵飞燕，不语到日西。\n手把菖蒲花，君王唤不来。\n常嫌鬓蝉重，乞人白玉钗。\n君心无定波，咫尺流不回。\n後宫门不掩，每夜黄鸟啼。\n买得千金赋，花颜已如灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}